Everyone-

The ceph-devel email list is moving to vger (where lots of Linux 
development lists live).  The new address is

	ceph-devel at vger.kernel.org

Please subscribe yourself to the new list by sending email to 
majordomo@vger.kernel.org with 'subscribe ceph-devel' in the message 
_body_.

Archiving isn't set up yet, but should be soon.

The move is prompted primarily by the annoying ads and the relatively poor 
spam filtering on sourceforge.  There's enough spam that gets through that 
I have to leave moderation (for non subscribers) on, which holds up 
legitimate mail on a regular basis.  It's also bad form to CC moderated 
lists as mailman will complain to people people who reply-all, which means 
I've been avoiding CC'ing ceph-devel on linux-kernel stuff.  Which is also 
bad form.  

Anyway, vger's filtering is pretty good, and mail seems to go through 
quite a bit faster than on sourceforge as well.

sage

